cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use cogTIDE in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "cogTIDE: Cognitive Theory Ideation, Debate, and Epistemic Evaluation"
abstract: >-
  cogTIDE is a peer-calibrated, auditable multi-stage LLM pipeline for
  generating candidate scientific theories from open-ended research questions
  in psychology, cognitive neuroscience, and cognitive science. Generated
  theories are hypotheses for expert review, not validated conclusions.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
