url: "https://github.com/XBTinChina/CogTIDE"               # TODO: confirm final URL
keywords:
  - large language models
  - theory generation
  - cognitive science
  - cognitive neuroscience
  - psychology
  - peer review
  - calibration
  - auditable AI
